Colormaps Information:
=====================

* To use CMAP colors check the following link for ColorCET:

  https://colorcet.com/index.html
  https://www.ncl.ucar.edu/Document/Graphics/color_table_gallery.shtml

  For example, use

  colormap(cmap('L10'));     % for Linear      color maps 'L1' - 'L19'
  colormap(cmap('C1'));      % for Cyclic      color maps 'C1' - 'C11'
  colormap(cmap('C1'));      % for Diverging   color maps 'D1' - 'D13'
  colormap(cmap('R1'));      % for Rainbow     color maps 'R1' - 'R4'
  colormap(cmap('I1'));      % for Isoliminant color maps 'I1' - 'I3'

* To use ODV palettes, use:

  cmap_odv('list')           % Prints a list of available palettes

  colormap(cmap_odv('Odv_437'));
  colormap(cmap_odv('Odv_465'));

* Color palettes for bathymery:

colormap(flipud(mpl_amwg256)); caxis([0 5000]);    % USEC 3km
